  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recovery of the critically endangered ricord&apos;s iguana through invasive species removal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recovery of the Critically Endangered Ricords Iguana through invasive species removal. In partnership with Island Conservation this project will increase the population of Ricords Iguana by removing three invasive species. Specific activities include: (1) Removal of remaining invasive feral cats, burros, and cattle from Isla Cabritos; (2) work with local officals to develop and implement an operational plan detailing field activities, staff and timeline, which also includes monitoring and evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
